window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b><i>When my family decide it's time to sell this omega off to secure their own future, I tell them to get knotted.</i></b><br> <br> Unfortunately, running from them lands me out of the frying pan and into the fire when my scent is picked up by the most superior pack in England.<br> <br> Gorgeous doesn't cover the alphas of the St. James pack and when they pick up my trail and abduct me, days before my first heat is due, things aren't going to end well for me. I'm totally out of my depth.<br> <br> I'm tied in knots, and I don't mean the fun kind. Do I have the courage to tell the alphas to get knotted as well or am I fighting a losing battle?<br> <br> <b>This is a non-shifting, Reverse Harem Omegaverse standalone with some content warnings. Please listen to the preface regarding these. Please note this is set in England with British characters using British English. Second edition.</b></p>"; 
